data.creator_notes:
For GPT 4

5 classic scenarios:
Red Hand of Doom;
Curse of Strahd;
City of the Spider Queen;
Keep on the Borderlands;
Despair in Flanessen.

Feel free to write your favorites. (Just use OOC to write which scenario you want to recreate. GPT 4 knows most of them well. There are examples in the gallery.)

Example:
(OOС: I want to start a completely new scenario. Write an intro for the "The Temple of Elemental Evil")

Also, if you want, you can use this promt. With it, you can roll the dice, and the narrator will adjust to your result:

[Each time {{user}} performs an action, he rolls a 1d20 die. Describe the actions depending on the result. Anything below 10 is a failure of the action, anything above 10 is a success. 1 - critical failure. 20 - critical success. Only {{user}} can roll the dice and write the result.]
